@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+## A final call to a function proven not to return (A32 and T32 chains) is
+## admitted; calls that may return, indirect branches, conditional final
+## calls, tail branches to returning code and recursion stay rejected.
+
+RUN: rm -rf %t.dir
+RUN: %python %p/Inputs/check-arm-noreturn-calls.py %t.dir
